{"id":"1d0e29e9558d4e2f","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadmincut.md","title":"Pointwise quadratic cut-capacity identity","display":"thm-quadmincut — Pointwise quadratic cut-capacity identity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadmincut","aliases":["27-thm-quadmincut"],"display":"thm-quadmincut — Pointwise quadratic cut-capacity identity","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadcut]]","[[27-thm-pbpoly]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.3","source_statement":"Local explicit proof of quadratic network representation","source_printed_pages":"603","source_pdf_pages":"627","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadmincut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadmincut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadmincut — Pointwise quadratic cut-capacity identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32e50ab8f941fd9b\" href=\"?note=32e50ab8f941fd9b\" title=\"27-df-quadcut\">27-df-quadcut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local explicit proof of quadratic network representation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"603"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"627"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q\">\\(c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32e50ab8f941fd9b\" href=\"?note=32e50ab8f941fd9b\" title=\"27-df-quadcut\">27-df-quadcut</a>）；q 的规范多线性表示（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{d_i,0\\}x_i+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{-d_i,0\\}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq n}\\frac{-b_{ij}}2|x_i-x_j|\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{d_i,0\\}x_i+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{-d_i,0\\}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq n}\\frac{-b_{ij}}2|x_i-x_j|\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：二值变量满足 |x_i−x_j|=x_i+x_j−2x_ix_j。展开容量后 pair 项贡献 b_ij x_ix_j 及 −b_ij/2 的两端线性项；与 d_i 定义相消，剩 a_i x_i。若 d_i&lt;0，常数项 d_i 与容量 (−d_i)(1−x_i) 相加为 d_i x_i；若 d_i≥0，容量本来就是 d_i x_i。于是规范多项式逐点相等。核对了原书 p.603 的对应背景，本公式与证明为明确展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadcut","status":"resolved","id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadcut]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbpoly","status":"resolved","id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbpoly]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadcut","status":"resolved","id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]）；q 的规范多线性表示（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbpoly","status":"resolved","id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]）；q 的规范多线性表示（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"c,a_i,b_{ij},d_i,\\kappa(q),\\gamma_q,\\mathrm{CutCap}_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{d_i,0\\}x_i+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max\\{-d_i,0\\}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{1\\leq i<j\\leq n}\\frac{-b_{ij}}2|x_i-x_j|\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1760,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-529","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadmincut|thm-quadmincut — Pointwise quadratic cut-capacity identity]]"},{"id":"a84438ff57f97872","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]），逐点容量等式（see [[27-thm-quadmincut]]）。"}],"outgoing":["32e50ab8f941fd9b","3153aa2be8b0a164"]}